{
  "id": "E280",
  "title": "Stir-fried Tomato and Scrambled Eggs",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-12-12",
  "synopsis": "Stir-fried tomato and scrambled eggs is probably the easiest Chinese dish to cook.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/920/bb7e113ab5b76db3d6fb76625347b01e57c9d74c.mp3?1543807891",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "番茄炒蛋真好吃 \n\n保罗：真香！你在做什么菜？\n小乐：番茄炒蛋。这是最普通的中国菜。\n保罗：我也想学做番茄炒蛋，难吗？\n小乐：不难，就是因为它很简单，所以很多人都喜欢做。",
    "traditional": "番茄炒蛋真好吃 \n\n保羅：真香！你在做什麼菜？\n小樂：番茄炒蛋。這是最普通的中國菜。\n保羅：我也想學做番茄炒蛋，難嗎？\n小樂：不難，就是因為它很簡單，所以很多人都喜歡做。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Stir-fried tomato and scrambled eggs is delicious"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：真香！你在做什么菜？",
      "traditional": "保羅：真香！你在做什麼菜？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó zhēn xiāng nǐ zài zuò shén me cài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Smells good! What dish are you cooking?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：番茄炒蛋。这是最普通的中国菜。",
      "traditional": "小樂：番茄炒蛋。這是最普通的中國菜。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè fān qié chǎo dàn zhè shì zuì pǔ tōng de zhōng guó cài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Stir-fried tomato and scrambled eggs. This is the most common Chinese dish."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：我也想学做番茄炒蛋，难吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：我也想學做番茄炒蛋，難嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ yě xiǎng xué zuò fān qié chǎo dàn nán ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I also want to learn how to cook stir-fried tomato and scrambled eggs. Is it difficult?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：不难，就是因为它很简单，所以很多人都喜欢做。",
      "traditional": "小樂：不難，就是因為它很簡單，所以很多人都喜歡做。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè bù nán jiù shì yīn wèi tā hěn jiǎn dān suǒ yǐ hěn duō rén dōu xǐ huan zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: No, many people like to cook it because it is simple."
    }
  ],
